01:11:52.167 --> 01:11:53.208
<i>Goodnight, Will.</i>

796
01:12:05.542 --> 01:12:06.542
What the fuck?

797
01:12:12.000 --> 01:12:14.000
We really need to do something about that.

798
01:12:21.167 --> 01:12:22.583
I think we should break up.

799
01:12:24.167 --> 01:12:25.375
I don't think this is working.

800
01:12:31.958 --> 01:12:32.958
Okay.

801
01:12:35.875 --> 01:12:36.875
That's all you got?

802
01:12:37.792 --> 01:12:38.792
"Okay"?

803
01:12:41.500 --> 01:12:44.333
Why are you acting offended?
You're breaking up with me.

804
01:12:46.542 --> 01:12:49.167
I can't believe how calmly
you're taking this whole thing.

805
01:12:54.000 --> 01:12:56.375
I guess you can probably find
a place to crash

806
01:12:56.458 --> 01:12:58.333
while you look for a new apartment, right?

807
01:13:00.250 --> 01:13:02.083
Already? Today?

808
01:13:06.458 --> 01:13:08.542
What did you expect? That we'd cuddle?

809
01:13:08.958 --> 01:13:10.208
Fuck you.

810
01:13:11.958 --> 01:13:13.125
I'm sorry.

811
01:13:15.708 --> 01:13:18.750
It's just this whole thing with the phone,
and the pictures.

812
01:13:20.375 --> 01:13:21.458
It's dangerous.

813
01:13:22.708 --> 01:13:24.333
And I don't want you anywhere around it.

814
01:13:24.792 --> 01:13:25.792
Really?

815
01:13:28.500 --> 01:13:29.583
Are you a hero now?

816
01:13:29.667 --> 01:13:30.708
Come on, Carrie.

817
01:13:31.292 --> 01:13:32.667
Do you hear yourself?

818
01:13:35.792 --> 01:13:36.792
You're scared.

819
01:13:38.125 --> 01:13:39.375
I'm scared, too.

820
01:13:41.167 --> 01:13:43.000
But I would never abandon you to it.

821
01:13:43.250 --> 01:13:44.458
That's not what I'm saying.

822
01:13:44.542 --> 01:13:45.542
Fuck you.

823
01:13:47.542 --> 01:13:49.542
I wasn't mad until just now.

824
01:13:50.167 --> 01:13:51.750
I was disappointed.

825
01:13:52.583 --> 01:13:53.583
I was hurt.

826
01:13:54.875 --> 01:13:56.417
But now, I'm just fucking pissed.

827
01:13:56.500 --> 01:13:59.083
So, if that's what you wanted,
then, you got it.

828
01:14:00.792 --> 01:14:01.833
It's not what I wanted.

829
01:14:03.542 --> 01:14:05.000
You know what I think you want?

830
01:14:08.500 --> 01:14:09.542
Nothing.

831
01:14:11.250 --> 01:14:13.542
Because there's nothing there to satisfy.

832
01:14:16.792 --> 01:14:18.792
You are a mock person.

833
01:14:22.792 --> 01:14:23.792
You're just a body.

834
01:15:32.375 --> 01:15:33.375
You okay?

835
01:15:36.708 --> 01:15:38.083
Fucking Doug say something?

836
01:15:38.750 --> 01:15:39.750
No.

837
01:15:42.208 --> 01:15:43.417
Did something happen?

838
01:15:46.125 --> 01:15:47.125
Nope.

839
01:15:50.000 --> 01:15:51.417
Well, you look like shit.

840
01:15:53.083 --> 01:15:54.500
Have you even showered today?

841
01:16:00.208 --> 01:16:01.250
Hit me again.

842
01:16:02.333 --> 01:16:03.667
I don't think that's a good idea.

843
01:16:04.708 --> 01:16:06.375
Your shift starts soon, anyway.

844
01:16:07.417 --> 01:16:08.792
I'm a grown ass man.

845
01:16:12.000 --> 01:16:13.458
Do I need to worry about you?

846
01:16:14.750 --> 01:16:15.750
Nope.

847
01:16:16.292 --> 01:16:17.583
You really don't, Rosie.

848
01:16:32.708 --> 01:16:35.333
- Oh! I'm sorry!
- Motherfucker!

849
01:16:35.417 --> 01:16:36.833
I can buy you another drink, man.

850
01:16:37.250 --> 01:16:38.750
- I don't want your drink!
- Hey!

851
01:16:38.833 --> 01:16:39.833
No problem, man.

852
01:16:47.708 --> 01:16:49.042
What's gotten into you?

853
01:16:52.000 --> 01:16:53.000
Go home.

854
01:16:53.292 --> 01:16:54.292
Take a shower.

855
01:16:54.500 --> 01:16:55.625
Get your head straight.

856
01:16:55.708 --> 01:16:56.708
What about my shift?

857
01:16:56.792 --> 01:16:58.712
Don't worry about it.
I'll cover you for tonight.

858
01:16:59.250 --> 01:17:00.375
I don't want you to.

859
01:17:01.417 --> 01:17:02.750
I don't want you to.

860
01:17:03.833 --> 01:17:04.833
Well...

861
01:17:05.708 --> 01:17:07.208
Fuck you, Rosie.

862
01:17:11.458 --> 01:17:12.458
Excuse me?

863
01:17:13.250 --> 01:17:14.250
Fuck me?

864
01:17:15.583 --> 01:17:16.583
Fuck you.

865
01:17:17.875 --> 01:17:19.792
Do you want to keep this job?

866
01:17:20.042 --> 01:17:21.250
Fuck your job.

867
01:17:35.250 --> 01:17:37.125
<i>Hey, it's Alicia. Leave a message.</i>

868
01:17:38.708 --> 01:17:40.750
Alicia, it's me. It's important.

869
01:17:40.833 --> 01:17:42.708
I need you to call me back.

870
01:17:44.500 --> 01:17:46.250
I know you're getting these messages.

871
01:17:48.333 --> 01:17:49.333
Fuck!

872
01:19:11.250 --> 01:19:12.250
Eric.

873
01:19:29.250 --> 01:19:30.250
Christ.

874
01:19:33.833 --> 01:19:34.833
Eric?

875
01:19:42.042 --> 01:19:43.042
Eric?

876
01:19:47.042 --> 01:19:48.208
Eric, you in here, man?

877
01:20:05.375 --> 01:20:06.625
How you living, man?

878
01:20:13.458 --> 01:20:14.792
Did someone break in here?

879
01:20:16.292 --> 01:20:17.500
What do you want?

880
01:20:19.750 --> 01:20:21.083
Just checking on you, man.

881
01:20:23.792 --> 01:20:24.792
I'm good.

882
01:20:27.792 --> 01:20:29.625
I gotta crash here for a few days.

883
01:20:33.458 --> 01:20:35.125
I gotta stay on your couch...

884
01:20:35.708 --> 01:20:36.792
for a day or two.

885
01:20:40.708 --> 01:20:41.708
No.

886
01:20:45.875 --> 01:20:47.208
I'm up against a wall, man.

887
01:20:47.500 --> 01:20:48.667
No!

888
01:20:55.083 --> 01:20:57.000
I'm gonna clean up
around here a little bit.

889
01:20:58.292 --> 01:20:59.292
It'll be good.

890
01:21:00.958 --> 01:21:02.042
Don't worry about it.

891
01:21:24.250 --> 01:21:26.000
<i>I said you shouldn't call here.</i>

892
01:21:26.792 --> 01:21:29.125
Yeah, but that was last night,
when you were with Jeffrey.

893
01:21:30.250 --> 01:21:31.750
Where are you now? Are you okay?

894
01:21:32.458 --> 01:21:34.625
<i>Will, I'm trying to fix my life, okay?</i>

895
01:21:35.583 --> 01:21:37.875
<i>I need you to stop calling me.
It's not helping.</i>

896
01:21:38.125 --> 01:21:39.125
Wait.

897
01:21:39.958 --> 01:21:40.958
I left Carrie.

898
01:21:42.375 --> 01:21:44.833
I broke up with her this morning.

899
01:21:48.542 --> 01:21:49.583
<i>I'm sorry?</i>

900
01:21:52.833 --> 01:21:54.292
<i>I'm sorry to hear that, Will.</i>

901
01:21:54.500 --> 01:21:57.542
No, that's, that's good news... right?

902
01:21:57.917 --> 01:22:00.333
<i>- I don't know. That's up to you.</i>
- Wait, don't. Alicia...

903
01:22:00.417 --> 01:22:01.833
<i>Will, I'm with Jeffrey.</i>

904
01:22:03.000 --> 01:22:05.000
<i>I love Jeffrey. Do you understand that?</i>

905
01:22:07.000 --> 01:22:08.000
No.

906
01:22:08.708 --> 01:22:10.458
No, I don't understand that at all.

907
01:22:10.542 --> 01:22:12.500
<i>I don't know when
we're coming back to the bar.</i>

908
01:22:12.583 --> 01:22:14.000
<i>Maybe not for a while, okay?</i>

909
01:22:15.083 --> 01:22:16.167
<i>Don't call me back.</i>

910
01:22:17.083 --> 01:22:19.542
<i>If you really care about me,
you cannot call me back.</i>

911
01:23:07.625 --> 01:23:09.708
You can't be in here.

912
01:23:12.458 --> 01:23:13.458
You hear me?

913
01:23:15.333 --> 01:23:16.625
I don't want you here.

914
01:23:20.083 --> 01:23:21.250
Didn't you call me?

915
01:23:26.083 --> 01:23:27.083
No.

916
01:23:31.625 --> 01:23:35.042
Someone called the bar last night
from this number, looking for me.

917
01:23:36.417 --> 01:23:38.375
If it wasn't you, who the fuck was it?

918
01:23:40.000 --> 01:23:41.375
They made me do it.

919
01:23:42.500 --> 01:23:43.583
Those freaks.

920
01:23:45.500 --> 01:23:47.125
Was it the fucking college kids?

921
01:23:48.167 --> 01:23:49.167
Was it?

922
01:23:50.000 --> 01:23:51.750
They told me to give you a present.

923
01:23:51.833 --> 01:23:53.417
Now get the fuck off me!

924
01:23:54.792 --> 01:23:55.833
I'll kill you.

925
01:23:57.292 --> 01:23:58.417
I'll kill you.

926
01:24:18.292 --> 01:24:19.667
What's the present, Eric?

927
01:25:13.500 --> 01:25:14.750
Are you the wrapping?

928
01:25:23.667 --> 01:25:25.625
You can feel it moving around in there.

929
01:25:26.875 --> 01:25:27.875
Can't you?

930
01:25:27.958 --> 01:25:28.958
Please leave.

931
01:25:29.208 --> 01:25:30.833
Shh.

932
01:25:31.625 --> 01:25:33.125
Most people don't know you.

933
01:25:33.500 --> 01:25:35.417
They don't see the evil

934
01:25:36.083 --> 01:25:38.000
and the ugly in your heart.

935
01:25:43.375 --> 01:25:44.958
You have to be dead first...

936
01:25:48.292 --> 01:25:50.625
or will they rip you open
while you're still alive.

937
01:25:56.667 --> 01:25:58.542
I wonder what would happen if I called it.

938
01:27:25.583 --> 01:27:29.292
Don't do it, please.
Don't do it! Don't do it! Don't do it!

939
01:27:31.083 --> 01:27:32.083
Don't do this.

940
01:27:58.542 --> 01:27:59.750
Fix me.

941
01:28:01.167 --> 01:28:02.708
Make me whole.
